# Project specific degradation phrases for checks/fail-closed.sh, one extended
# regex per line, matched case insensitively. A line of production code that
# calls a warning and matches one of these fails the build: a missing
# protection must refuse to start, not log and carry on.
# The built-in list already covers phrases such as "running without" and
# "degraded mode". Lines starting with "#" are comments.
